9":{"id":"/disk-wizard-35","page_id":"/disk-wizard","tags":["disk","wizard","docker","huggingface","ollama","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/disk-wizard#three-tools-do-not-mix-them-up","content":"`--plan`"},"200":{"id":"/disk-wizard-36","page_id":"/disk-wizard","tags":["disk","wizard","docker","huggingface","ollama","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/disk-wizard#three-tools-do-not-mix-them-up","content":"Safe junk after `--apply --yes`; review-class **quarantines**"},"201":{"id":"/disk-wizard-37","page_id":"/disk-wizard","tags":["disk","wizard","docker","huggingface","ollama","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/disk-wizard#three-tools-do-not-mix-them-up","content":"Never offered: `docker system prune -a --volumes`. That would eat other stacks' volumes."},"202":{"id":"/disk-wizard-38","page_id":"/disk-wizard","tags":["disk","wizard","docker","huggingface","ollama","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/disk-wizard#wizard-steps","content":"**Survey** (always read-only) — `df`, Docker `system df` when available, catalog matches, top files under allowed roots."},"203":{"id":"/disk-wizard-39","page_id":"/disk-wizard","tags":["disk","wizard","docker","huggingface","ollama","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/disk-wizard#wizard-steps","content":"**Explain + rank** — largest *likely leftover* first. Each row: what / why / risk / reclaim / whether something is running."},"204":{"id":"/disk-wizard-40","page_id":"/disk-wizard","tags":["disk","wizard","docker","huggingface","ollama","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/disk-wizard#wizard-steps","content":"**Guide in three steps**"},"205":{"id":"/disk-wizard-41","page_id":"/disk-wizard","tags":["disk","wizard","docker","huggingface","ollama","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/disk-wizard#wizard-steps","content":"**A — Safe junk** — `*.incomplete`, dangling Comfy symlinks, unused Docker **build cache**, detached HF revisions, core dumps. Default accept on `--apply`."},"206":{"id":"/disk-wizard-42","page_id":"/disk-wizard","tags":["disk","wizard","docker","huggingface","ollama","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/disk-wizard#wizard-steps","content":"**B — Review leftovers** — unused named images, HF hub repos that are not the lab keep-set, Ollama blobs, opt-in Comfy packs, large MP4s under `COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR`. Default **skip**. Set `DISK_WIZARD_STEP_B=1` to quarantine those when applying."},"207":{"id":"/disk-wizard-43","page_id":"/disk-wizard","tags":["disk","wizard","docker","huggingface","ollama","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/disk-wizard#wizard-steps","content":"**C — Will not touch** — default keep-set weights, `ez-comfy-state` (use `cleanup`), images of running containers, path escape, other users' homes."},"208":{"id":"/disk-wizard-44","page_id":"/disk-wizard","tags":["disk","wizard","docker","huggingface","ollama","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/disk-wizard#wizard-steps","content":"**Confirm** — `--apply --yes`. Log: `${MODELS_DIR}/.disk-wizard.log`."},"209":{"id":"/disk-wizard-45","page_id":"/disk-wizard","tags":["disk","wizard","docker","huggingface","ollama","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/disk-wizard#wizard-steps","content":"`--plan` (and `--json`) print **stderr progress immediately**: start banner, `df`, each allowed root as it is scanned, a heartbeat on large trees, Docker `system df`, then ranking. A full Spark (`~/.cache`, `/tmp`, Docker) can still take a while — it will not sit silent. `--json` keeps a single JSON array on **stdout**; progress stays on stderr. Heartbeat interval: `DISK_WIZARD_PROGRESS_INTERVAL` seconds (default `2`; `0` disables in-root heartbeats, not the per-root lines)."},"210":{"id":"/disk-wizard-46","page_id":"/disk-wizard","tags":["disk","wizard","docker","huggingface","ollama","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/disk-wizard#what-a-row-means","content":"Field"},"211":{"id":"/disk-wizard-47","page_id":"/disk-wizard","tags":["disk","wizard","docker","huggingface","ollama","safety"],"type":"text","url":"/disk-wizard#what-a-row-means","content":"Meaning"},"212":{"id":"/disk-wizard-48","pag