"text","url":"/project-conventions#bazel-first-workflow","content":"`bazelisk run //:fix`"},"1248":{"id":"/project-conventions-56","page_id":"/project-conventions","tags":["conventions","contributing","safety","shell","google-style"],"type":"text","url":"/project-conventions#bazel-first-workflow","content":"Shell structured comments"},"1249":{"id":"/project-conventions-57","page_id":"/project-conventions","tags":["conventions","contributing","safety","shell","google-style"],"type":"text","url":"/project-conventions#bazel-first-workflow","content":"`bazelisk run //docs:docs`"},"1250":{"id":"/project-conventions-58","page_id":"/project-conventions","tags":["conventions","contributing","safety","shell","google-style"],"type":"text","url":"/project-conventions#bazel-first-workflow","content":"See Building with Bazel. Runtime is still Docker Compose — Bazel does not add K3s, a dashboard, or NCCL."},"1251":{"id":"/project-conventions-59","page_id":"/project-conventions","tags":["conventions","contributing","safety","shell","google-style"],"type":"text","url":"/project-conventions#repo-layout","content":"Shipped Comfy graphs live under `workflows/_lab/<lane>/` (`stills`, `motion`, `creator`, `films`, `dcc`, `optional`, `audio`, `inspire`). Filenames drop lane prefixes and the old `-lab-example` suffix (`stills/still-draft.json`). Nested folders under a lane are allowed. Creator platform Apps nest as `_lab/creator/<kind>/<stem>.json` (`creator/stills/youtube-channel-icon`). Motion printers nest as `_lab/motion/silent|loops|av/`. Film JSON lives under `_lab/films/` (shot YAML stays in `workflows/shorts/`). Music catalogs nest as `_lab/audio/albums/<artist>/<album-slug>/` with numbered tracks plus `cover.json` and `album.json`. Tags carry artist/album/title; SaveAudio stem is `NN - Song Title`. Graph `id` is the file stem; `extra.lab_rel` is the unique `_lab`-relative id; `extra.workflowRendererVersion` is `Vue-corrected` (Nodes 2.0 canonical coordinates — never stamp `\"Vue\"`). Node `pos` is spaced for Vue widget height (`tests/python/_lab_layout.py`: estimated AABB + `NODE_GAP`, groups keep `GROUP_TITLE_INSET`; DCC and TRELLIS are not exempt). Do not pack to LiteGraph `size` alone. Per-graph node/parameter pages are generated (`docs/generate_workflow_docs.py`, encyclopedia `docs/workflow_nodes.py`) into `docs/generated/workflows/` — do not hand-edit them. Shot YAML stays in `workflows/shorts/*.shots.yaml`. `workflows/_user/` is a local convention only — live private graphs are on `${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}/comfy-user/default/workflows/_user/` (plus `_user/_rescued/` for in-place lab edits) and must not be committed."},"1252":{"id":"/project-conventions-60","page_id":"/project-conventions","tags":["conventions","contributing","safety","shell","google-style"],"type":"text","url":"/project-conventions#shell-style","content":"**Primary reference:** Google Shell Style Guide."},"1253":{"id":"/project-conventions-61","page_id":"/project-conventions","tags":["conventions","contributing","safety","shell","google-style"],"type":"text","url":"/project-conventions#shell-style","content":"This project follows that guide for executables and libraries, with the **intentional deviations** below. When the guide and this page conflict, this page wins for the listed deviations only."},"1254":{"id":"/project-conventions-62","page_id":"/project-conventions","tags":["conventions","contributing","safety","shell","google-style"],"type":"text","url":"/project-conventions#rules-we-follow-summary","content":"Area"},"1255":{"id":"/project-conventions-63","page_id":"/project-conventions","tags":["conventions","contributing","safety","shell","google-style"],"type":"text","url":"/project-conventions#rules-we-follow-summary","content":"Rule"},"1256":{"id":"/project-conventions-64","page_id":"/project-conventions","tags":["conventions","contributing","safety","shell","google-style"],"type":"text","url":"/project-conventions#rules-we-follow-summary","content":"Language"},"