ntent":"Why containers do not auto-return after reboot"},"1387":{"id":"/reboot-safety-9","page_id":"/reboot-safety","tags":["safety","reboot"],"type":"text","url":"/reboot-safety#reboot-safety","content":"Recovery when SSH is already unresponsive"},"1388":{"id":"/reboot-safety-10","page_id":"/reboot-safety","tags":["safety","reboot"],"type":"text","url":"/reboot-safety#reboot-safety","content":"Why this is a human problem (remote box, no console), not a Docker quirk"},"1389":{"id":"/reboot-safety-11","page_id":"/reboot-safety","tags":["safety","reboot"],"type":"text","url":"/reboot-safety#reboot-safety","content":"**What this enables**"},"1390":{"id":"/reboot-safety-12","page_id":"/reboot-safety","tags":["safety","reboot"],"type":"text","url":"/reboot-safety#reboot-safety","content":"Rebooting a Spark without losing SSH recoverability or corrupting long downloads"},"1391":{"id":"/reboot-safety-13","page_id":"/reboot-safety","tags":["safety","reboot"],"type":"text","url":"/reboot-safety#golden-rule","content":"Always `stop` first. Compose uses `restart: \"no\"` so the stack will **not** come back by itself — that is intentional, but a live GPU load during reboot still risks painful recovery. Independent Spark farm containers still use `restart: \"no\"`; `spark-farm.sh` never starts compose on a remote node."},"1392":{"id":"/reboot-safety-14","page_id":"/reboot-safety","tags":["safety","reboot"],"type":"text","url":"/reboot-safety#sequence","content":"From your workstation / SSH session:"},"1393":{"id":"/reboot-safety-15","page_id":"/reboot-safety","tags":["safety","reboot"],"type":"text","url":"/reboot-safety#sequence","content":"Reboot the node (`sudo reboot` or out-of-band BMC)."},"1394":{"id":"/reboot-safety-16","page_id":"/reboot-safety","tags":["safety","reboot"],"type":"text","url":"/reboot-safety#sequence","content":"After boot, verify Docker and GPU:"},"1395":{"id":"/reboot-safety-17","page_id":"/reboot-safety","tags":["safety","reboot"],"type":"text","url":"/reboot-safety#sequence","content":"Only then start again:"},"1396":{"id":"/reboot-safety-18","page_id":"/reboot-safety","tags":["safety","reboot"],"type":"text","url":"/reboot-safety#sequence","content":"`start` returns after `compose up -d`. Closing the SSH session does **not** stop the stack. `stop` is still required before reboot. Independent Spark farm containers still use `restart: \"no\"`; start each node locally with confirm."},"1397":{"id":"/reboot-safety-19","page_id":"/reboot-safety","tags":["safety","reboot"],"type":"text","url":"/reboot-safety#why-containers-do-not-return","content":"Compose uses `restart: \"no\"`. There is no systemd unit that auto-starts this demo. That is intentional."},"1398":{"id":"/reboot-safety-20","page_id":"/reboot-safety","tags":["safety","reboot"],"type":"text","url":"/reboot-safety#why-containers-do-not-return","content":"Manual start + headroom preflight + heavy confirmation keep remote SSH recoverable. Do not add auto-start units for this demo stack."},"1399":{"id":"/reboot-safety-21","page_id":"/reboot-safety","tags":["safety","reboot"],"type":"text","url":"/reboot-safety#if-ssh-is-already-unresponsive","content":"Use **BMC / serial console**"},"1400":{"id":"/reboot-safety-22","page_id":"/reboot-safety","tags":["safety","reboot"],"type":"text","url":"/reboot-safety#if-ssh-is-already-unresponsive","content":"**Hard power cycle** only as last resort"},"1401":{"id":"/reboot-safety-23","page_id":"/reboot-safety","tags":["safety","reboot"],"type":"text","url":"/reboot-safety#if-ssh-is-already-unresponsive","content":"After recovery:"},"1402":{"id":"/shorts","page_id":"/shorts","type":"page","content":"Short films","breadcrumbs":["Docs"],"tags":["shorts","wan","ltx","klein","youtube","comfyui"],"url":"/shorts"},"1403":{"id":"/shorts-0","page_id":"/shorts","tags":["shorts","wan","ltx","klein","youtube","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/shorts","content":"Queue 90s one-click films, or five 90s acts that concat to a 7.5 min master,