,"1483":{"id":"/shorts-80","page_id":"/shorts","tags":["shorts","wan","ltx","klein","youtube","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/shorts#operator-loop","content":"Each film graph ships **Klein identity + 18 LTX 5.00s printers + in-graph stitch**. Prompts are baked from `{film}.shots.yaml` (Klein `identity_look`, LTX `ltx_i2v`). Host JSON lives at `workflows/_lab/films/`; YAML shot lists stay at `workflows/shorts/*.shots.yaml` (not copied into Comfy). The entrypoint rsyncs JSON into `user/default/workflows/_lab/films/`. Restart so `custom_nodes/ez_film` is copied with the other in-tree packs."},"1484":{"id":"/shorts-81","page_id":"/shorts","tags":["shorts","wan","ltx","klein","youtube","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/shorts#operator-loop","content":"Load one film graph (`films/go-see` / `films/still-here` / `films/switchyard`)."},"1485":{"id":"/shorts-82","page_id":"/shorts","tags":["shorts","wan","ltx","klein","youtube","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/shorts#operator-loop","content":"Queue **once**. Klein runs first (4-step). Models unload. Then 18 × **5.00s** LTX prints chain last-frame → next start. All three films pin Enhance **off** on identity and every LTX shot. Leave LTX **1280×704**."},"1486":{"id":"/shorts-83","page_id":"/shorts","tags":["shorts","wan","ltx","klein","youtube","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/shorts#operator-loop","content":"Wall-clock is 18 sequential 5s prints (tens of minutes to a couple of hours on GB10). That is expected, not a hang. Headroom preflight still applies at start."},"1487":{"id":"/shorts-84","page_id":"/shorts","tags":["shorts","wan","ltx","klein","youtube","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/shorts#operator-loop","content":"After Queue, the stitched file is already written to `${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}/ez_<slug>_90s.mp4` (H.264 + AAC + faststart) plus `ez_<slug>_90s.html`. A **90s film ready** overlay plays and downloads it. Per-shot files remain as `ez_<slug>_bN_sM_ltx_video_*.mp4`. Copy off the Spark with `scp`. Optional: studio-ui `/watch/<slug>`."},"1488":{"id":"/shorts-85","page_id":"/shorts","tags":["shorts","wan","ltx","klein","youtube","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/shorts#operator-loop","content":"Optional silent rehearsal of one frame: **motion/silent/still-to-shot**. Optional single-shot iterate: **motion/av/still-to-shot**.\nShot-level resume lives under `${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}/films/<slug>/` (`state.json`, `shots/NN.mp4`). A dropped SSH session is not a two-hour requeue:"},"1489":{"id":"/shorts-86","page_id":"/shorts","tags":["shorts","wan","ltx","klein","youtube","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/shorts#operator-loop","content":"Host / spark-farm fallback (when you printed shots outside the one-click graph):"},"1490":{"id":"/shorts-87","page_id":"/shorts","tags":["shorts","wan","ltx","klein","youtube","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/shorts#operator-loop","content":"Optional jobstore board (no GPU, 512m, `restart: \"no\"`). Default `start` does **not** launch it:"},"1491":{"id":"/shorts-88","page_id":"/shorts","tags":["shorts","wan","ltx","klein","youtube","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/shorts#operator-loop","content":"LTX Director is a **GPL** clone into the Comfy volume, not this MIT tree:"},"1492":{"id":"/shorts-89","page_id":"/shorts","tags":["shorts","wan","ltx","klein","youtube","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/shorts#operator-loop","content":"Refuse MiniMax H3 Director. OpenCut (`jtydhr88/ComfyUI-OpenCut`, MIT) is fail-soft. Not the OpenCut Rust rewrite, not Next.js+Postgres."},"1493":{"id":"/spark-farm","page_id":"/spark-farm","type":"page","content":"Spark farm","breadcrumbs":["Docs"],"tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"url":"/spark-farm"},"1494":{"id":"/spark-farm-0","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm","content":"Three DGX Sparks as independent Comfy workers plus a shared model cache — no NCCL, no MiniMax H3."},"1495":{"id":"/spark-farm-1","page_id":"/spark-farm","type":"heading","tags":["spark","fa