erred):** Spark-0 exports `${MODELS_DIR}` (default `/mnt/models`); Sparks 1–2 mount it. Compose already bind-mounts `${MODELS_DIR}:/models`."},"1522":{"id":"/spark-farm-28","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#runbook-numbered","content":"**Replica:** `./scripts/utilities/spark-farm.sh sync-models` rsyncs `MODELS_DIR/comfy&#x60; over **`SPARK_FABRIC_IPS` only** (not the management NIC). Needs at least two fabric addresses."},"1523":{"id":"/spark-farm-29","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#runbook-numbered","content":"**Per-node setup / doctor / download / start** — on **each** Spark, operator, with confirm. Type **yes** locally. Never `ssh … compose up`."},"1524":{"id":"/spark-farm-30","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#runbook-numbered","content":"**Probe** (does not start compose):"},"1525":{"id":"/spark-farm-31","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#runbook-numbered","content":"**Dispatch** `print-shot` (shots **01–06 / 07–12 / 13–18** on three hosts, or an even split on two). SSH-runs **local** `./scripts/manage.sh print-shot` only:"},"1526":{"id":"/spark-farm-32","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#runbook-numbered","content":"**Concat locally** (gather is under `${FARM_SHARE}/out`; concat on spark-0):"},"1527":{"id":"/spark-farm-33","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#runbook-numbered","content":"Director is **off** this path. See 90s shorts."},"1528":{"id":"/spark-farm-34","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fabric","comfyui"],"type":"text","url":"/spark-farm#farm-vs-relay","content":"Mode"},"1529":{"id":"/spark-farm-35","page_id":"/spark-farm","tags":["spark","farm","fab