ge. Clips live under `docs/assets/cinema/<axis_id>/<technique_id>.mp4` (Git LFS) with a JPEG poster; compress with `./scripts/utilities/compress-cinema-clip.sh`."},"2331":{"id":"/create/cinema-rack-62","page_id":"/create/cinema-rack","tags":["cinema","prompting","klein","wan","ltx","inspire"],"type":"text","url":"/create/cinema-rack#axes","content":"Klein sentence order is cinematic grammar, not widget order: shot size → angle → lens → composition → lighting → color → weather → genre → viral → time → move → optical → edit."},"2332":{"id":"/create/cinema-rack-63","page_id":"/create/cinema-rack","tags":["cinema","prompting","klein","wan","ltx","inspire"],"type":"text","url":"/create/cinema-rack#flavors","content":"Family"},"2333":{"id":"/create/cinema-rack-64","page_id":"/create/cinema-rack","tags":["cinema","prompting","klein","wan","ltx","inspire"],"type":"text","url":"/create/cinema-rack#flavors","content":"What the rack emits"},"2334":{"id":"/create/cinema-rack-65","page_id":"/create/cinema-rack","tags":["cinema","prompting","klein","wan","ltx","inspire"],"type":"text","url":"/create/cinema-rack#flavors","content":"`klein` / `klein_edit`"},"2335":{"id":"/create/cinema-rack-66","page_id":"/create/cinema-rack","tags":["cinema","prompting","klein","wan","ltx","inspire"],"type":"text","url":"/create/cinema-rack#flavors","content":"Subject + still clauses. Motion axes use the `still` freeze. Editing dropped."},"2336":{"id":"/create/cinema-rack-67","page_id":"/create/cinema-rack","tags":["cinema","prompting","klein","wan","ltx","inspire"],"type":"text","url":"/create/cinema-rack#flavors","content":"`klein_identity`"},"2337":{"id":"/create/cinema-rack-68","page_id":"/create/cinema-rack","tags":["cinema","prompting","klein","wan","ltx","inspire"],"type":"text","url":"/create/cinema-rack#flavors","content":"Lighting / color / weather / genre only. No camera, angle, move, or edit (bible stays camera-free)."},"2338":{"id":"/create/cinema-rack-69","page_id":"/create/cinema-rack","tags":["cinema","prompting","klein","wan","ltx","inspire"],"type":"text","url":"/create/cinema-rack#flavors","content":"`wan_t2v`"},"2339":{"id":"/create/cinema-rack-70","page_id":"/create/cinema-rack","tags":["cinema","prompting","klein","wan","ltx","inspire"],"type":"text","url":"/create/cinema-rack#flavors","content":"Look clauses + **exactly one** camera token (`wan_token`, else `fixed camera`)."},"2340":{"id":"/create/cinema-rack-71","page_id":"/create/cinema-rack","tags":["cinema","prompting","klein","wan","ltx","inspire"],"type":"text","url":"/create/cinema-rack#flavors","content":"`wan_i2v`"},"2341":{"id":"/create/cinema-rack-72","page_id":"/create/cinema-rack","tags":["cinema","prompting","klein","wan","ltx","inspire"],"type":"text","url":"/create/cinema-rack#flavors","content":"Camera + time/optical/edit only. Subject ignored. Start image owns look."},"2342":{"id":"/create/cinema-rack-73","page_id":"/create/cinema-rack","tags":["cinema","prompting","klein","wan","ltx","inspire"],"type":"text","url":"/create/cinema-rack#flavors","content":"`ltx_t2v` / `ltx_i2v`"},"2343":{"id":"/create/cinema-rack-74","page_id":"/create/cinema-rack","tags":["cinema","prompting","klein","wan","ltx","inspire"],"type":"text","url":"/create/cinema-rack#flavors","content":"Present-tense clauses. Weather/optical `audio` interleaved. I2V still drops look axes."},"2344":{"id":"/create/cinema-rack-75","page_id":"/create/cinema-rack","tags":["cinema","prompting","klein","wan","ltx","inspire"],"type":"text","url":"/create/cinema-rack#flavors","content":"Style dropdown on the Enhance nodes stays **none** so `apply_style_to_prompt` does not strip cinema grade language. Use the 150 style presets when you want a medium (anime, watercolor); use Cinema Rack when you want camera/light/time."},"2345":{"id":"/create/cinema-rack-76","page_id":"/create/cinema-rack","tags":["cinema","prompting","klein","wan","ltx","inspire"],"type":"text","url":"/create/cinema-rack#flavors","content":"Lazy Prompt Enhance (Klein / Wan / LTX and the other visual families) now **writes** this same catalog language: named shot sizes, lighting patterns, millimetre-equivalent lenses, recipe packages adapted to the user's inventory, and exactly one Wan token. The rack remains the deterministic dropdown splice; Enhance is the 4B rewriter that should sound like the rack."},"2346":{"id":"/create/cinema-rack-77","page_id":"/create/cinema-rack","tags":["cinema","prompting","klein","wan","ltx","inspire"],"type":"text","url":"/create/cinema-rack#recipes-and-conflicts","content":"A **Recipe** fills axes that are still `none`. An explicit dropdown always wins."},"2347":{"id":"/create/cinema-rack-78","page_id":"/create/cinema-rack","tags":["cinema","prompting","klein","wan","ltx","inspire"],"type":"text","url":"/create/cinema-rack#recipes-and-conflicts","content":"When two picks conflict, the **later splice-order** axis wins (viral may override color; a camera move may drop an optical smash-zoom). Notes on the rack list what was dropped."},"2348":{"id":"/create/cinema-rack-79","page_id":"/create/cinema-rack","tags":["cinema","prompting","klein","wan","ltx","inspire"],"type":"text","url":"/create/cinema-rack#recipes-and-conflicts","content":"Wan never emits two camera verbs. Do not also type `dolly in` in the subject."},"2349":{"id":"/create/cinema-rack-80","page_id":"/create/cinema-rack","tags":["cinema","prompting","klein","wan","ltx","inspire"],"type":"text","url":"/create/cinema-rack#handoff","content":"Queue **inspire/cinema-rack** (occupancy **llm**)."},"2350":{"id":"/create/cinema-rack-81","page_id":"/create/cinema-rack","tags":["cinema","prompting","klein","wan","ltx","inspire"],"type":"text","url":"/create/cinema-rack#handoff","content":"Copy the Klein / Wan / LTX CLIP box."},"2351":{"id":"/create/cinema-rack-82","page_id":"/create/cinema-rack","tags":["cinema","prompting","klein","wan","ltx","inspire"],"type":"text","url":"/create/cinema-rack#handoff","content":"Paste into **stills/still-draft**, **motion/silent/text-to-video-5s**, or **motion/av/text-to-video-12s**. For I2V, set Family to `wan_i2v` / `ltx_i2v` first so look axes are already omitted."},"2352":{"id":"/create/cinema-rack-83","page_id":"/create/cinema-rack","tags":["cinema","prompting","klein","wan","ltx","inspire"],"type":"text","url":"/create/cinema-rack#handoff","content":"Optional: turn Enhance **off** on the destination if the rack string is already model-native."},"2353":{"id":"/create/cinema-rack-84","page_id":"/create/cinema-rack","tags":["cinema","prompting","klein","wan","ltx","inspire"],"type":"text","url":"/create/cinema-rack#handoff","content":"Safety impact: none. Prompt JSON + CPU node. No Docker, restart, or headroom change."},"2354":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","type":"page","content":"Music disclosure","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Create"],"tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"url":"/create/music-disclosure"},"2355":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-0","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-disclosure","content":"DistroKid, Spotify, YouTube, and USCO disclosure for ACE-Step rap and EDM, plus tags vs lyrics, Hard no, and QC. Not legal advice."},"2356":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-1","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","type":"heading","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"url":"/create/music-disclosure#music-disclosure","content":"Music disclosure"},"2357":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-2","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","type":"heading","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"url":"/create/music-disclosure#tags-vs-lyrics","content":"Tags vs lyrics"},"2358":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-3","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","type":"heading","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"url":"/create/music-disclosure#distrokid-spotify-youtube-authorship","content":"DistroKid, Spotify, YouTube, authorship"},"2359":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-4","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","type":"heading","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"url":"/create/music-disclosure#qc","content":"QC"},"2360":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-5","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","type":"heading","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"url":"/create/music-disclosure#hard-no","content":"Hard no"},"2361":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-6","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-disclosure#music-disclosure","content":"**What's on this page**"},"2362":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-7","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-disclosure#music-disclosure","content":"**Tags vs lyrics** (vocal hints are not a rights grant)"},"2363":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-8","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-disclosure#music-disclosure","content":"**DistroKid / Spotify / YouTube / USCO Part 2** disclosure"},"2364":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-9","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-disclosure#music-disclosure","content":"**Hard no** vendors and prompts"},"2365":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-10","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-disclosure#music-disclosure","content":"**QC** before any release"},"2366":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-11","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-disclosure#music-disclosure","content":"**What this enables**"},"2367":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-12","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-disclosure#music-disclosure","content":"**Keeping RAP-FIRST and Drive-through takes** original, disclosed, and off banned vendors"},"2368":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-13","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-disclosure#music-disclosure","content":"**A human rewrite plus selection** before anyone treats a Queue as a release"},"2369":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-14","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-disclosure#music-disclosure","content":"**Who this is for:** studio users who already Queued **audio/music/rap-draft**. Overview: Local music. RAP-FIRST: Nill Bye albums. EDM: Drive-through EDM."},"2370":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-15","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-disclosure#music-disclosure","content":"Platform rules and copyright change. Read the current DistroKid, Spotify, YouTube, FTC, and USCO pages before you monetize."},"2371":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-16","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-disclosure#tags-vs-lyrics","content":"**Tags** describe genre, drums, bass, booth, vocal character, and bpm."},"2372":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-17","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-disclosure#tags-vs-lyrics","content":"**Lyrics** are the bars (rap) or the arrangement **structure** (Drive-through EDM). Section labels `[intro]`, `[verse]`, `[chorus]`, `[outro]`, and `[spoken word]` are vocal **hints** operators may add — they are not a rights grant. EDM graphs use empty-body `[drop]` / `[inst]` / `[outro]` with production cues **inside the brackets**. ACE-Step sings any free-text line under a marker. Eighty-three takes stay instrumental (encoder language `unknown`). Two bass-set treats add one 1–2 word `[chorus]` DJ chop (never `[verse]`). Do not put the act name in the score — ACE will sing it."},"2373":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-18","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-disclosure#tags-vs-lyrics","content":"**Original lyrics only.** Do not write “in the style of \\<living artist>”. No living-MC names. No famous-hook paraphrases."},"2374":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-19","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-disclosure#tags-vs-lyrics","content":"**Short percussive lines** (about 6–10 syllables) slur less. Keep `language=en` on `TextEncodeAceStepAudio1.5` (combo, not free text). The seeded graph stores seed control as **fixed** after the seed; re-open **audio/music/rap-draft** after a pull so those combos stay aligned."},"2375":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-20","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-disclosure#tags-vs-lyrics","content":"ACE-Step generates the vocal from lyrics + tags. That timbre is an **invented identity**, not a cloned MC. Do not add Kokoro / Chatterbox / TTS-Audio-Suite to these graphs."},"2376":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-21","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-disclosure#distrokid-spotify-youtube-authorship","content":"**DistroKid / Spotify:** you must own the rights. Disclose AI lyrics + vocals + instrumental. If the artist identity is fake, Spotify may treat it as an “AI Persona” — prefer a **human artist name** with disclosed AI production."},"2377":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-22","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-disclosure#distrokid-spotify-youtube-authorship","content":"**YouTube:** use the synthetic-audio / altered-content flag. Mass-upload of near-duplicates is inauthentic content."},"2378":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-23","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-disclosure#distrokid-spotify-youtube-authorship","content":"**USCO Part 2 / Thaler:** edit the lyrics. Prompts are not authorship. A human rewrite plus selection and arrangement can be; raw generations are not registrable."},"2379":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-24","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-disclosure#qc","content":"Do this **before any release**. These graphs are lab takes, not masters."},"2380":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-25","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-disclosure#qc","content":"**Human rewrite** the lyrics on RAP-FIRST full tracks and every Nill Bye take. Seeded bars stay short and SFW."},"2381":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-26","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-disclosure#qc","content":"**Human selection and edit** on Drive-through EDM. Arrangement scores are empty-body structure tags, not a verse/chorus loop."},"2382":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-27","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-disclosure#qc","content":"**Punch up** on diss phases; **build up** on progress phases. Do not roast disability, race, faith, children, or people at the river."},"2383":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-28","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-disclosure#qc","content":"**No living-MC names** and no famous-hook paraphrases. Each Nill Bye take owns exclusive verses and punchlines — content bars are not reused across the one hundred thirty-five graphs; choruses stay unique hooks."},"2384":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-29","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-disclosure#qc","content":"**ACE-Step vocal** is an invented identity, not a clone. Do not add Kokoro / Chatterbox / TTS-Audio-Suite to these graphs."},"2385":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-30","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-disclosure#qc","content":"**Cover still** in a later Klein session. Do not co-resident with LTX / Wan / Klein."},"2386":{"id":"/create/music-disclosure-31","page_id":"/create/music-disclosure","tags":["music","disclosure","distrokid","spotify","youtube","usco","us-safe"],"type":"text","url":"/create/music-disclosure#hard-no","content":"Do not vendor or default:"},"238