e","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#dream-house-tours","content":"`start` seeds LoadImage plates so the clay App can Queue without a dump"},"3362":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-11","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#dream-house-tours","content":"**What this enables**"},"3363":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-12","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#dream-house-tours","content":"Keeping **stills/dream-house** as a one-Queue language tour"},"3364":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-13","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#dream-house-tours","content":"Using a real 3D scene so rooms stay adjacent while Klein only paints materials"},"3365":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-14","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#dream-house-tours","content":"**Who this is for:** studio users who already Queued the T2I dream-house and want the rooms to share a floorplan."},"3366":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-15","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#two-doors","content":"The T2I tour remembers the place in prose (`HOUSE IDENTITY` + Prompt Join `lock=view`). The clay tour remembers it as geometry: Blender dumps ten Workbench stills from named cameras, then Klein **edit** restyles each plate."},"3367":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-16","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#two-doors","content":"Graph"},"3368":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-17","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#two-doors","content":"Persistence"},"3369":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-18","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#two-doors","content":"When"},"3370":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-19","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#two-doors","content":"**stills/dream-house**"},"3371":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-20","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#two-doors","content":"Prompt Join `lock=view`. Independent T2I"},"3372":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-21","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#two-doors","content":"No Blender, or you want a one-Queue draft"},"3373":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-22","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#two-doors","content":"**stills/dream-house-clay**"},"3374":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-23","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#two-doors","content":"One greybox + ten cameras. Klein edit + `ReferenceLatent`"},"3375":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-24","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#two-doors","content":"You want the kitchen to stay next to the lounge. `start` seeds plates; Blender dump is optional Workbench quality"},"3376":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-25","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#two-doors","content":"Same ten cameras (tower, foyer, lounge, kitchen, dining, bedroom, bath, terrace, drone, study). Same 1024×1280 Instagram 4:5. Same optional style dropdown on the bible. Prefixes do **not** collide. Language-tour shot cards are walkthrough cameras (lens, height, a distinct room program, near/far, which room); type the place — materials, time of day, architecture — in **HOUSE IDENTITY**. Each still names its own room (entrance hall, living hall, cook line, dining hall, sleep chamber, wet room, open-air terrace, writing room) so a Queue reads as a tour, not one volume with different finishes."},"3377":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-26","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#two-doors","content":"TRELLIS.2 is a hero-piece tool, not a walkable house. Do not TRELLIS a full-scene still and expect a foyer. Godot is P2 — `house-views` is Blender only."},"3378":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-27","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#clay-loop","content":"`manage.sh start` seeds `ez_house_clay_01.png` … `10.png` into `${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}/input` (container `/inputs`) so LoadImage can Queue. If a `house-views` pack already exists it is copied; otherwise the shipped `schemas/house_layout.yaml` cameras are rendered (no Blender). Reload the App if it was open before seed."},"3379":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-28","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#clay-loop","content":"Optional Workbench dump (higher quality) — host Blender, then park or stop Comfy:"},"3380":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-29","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#clay-loop","content":"Dump lives under `${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}/assets/sets/<slug>/` (layout, `mesh/house.glb`, `views/`, `depth/`). Clay copies `ez_house_clay_01.png` … `10.png` land in that folder and in `${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}/input`. LoadImage does **not** list the output root."},"3381":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-30","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#clay-loop","content":"Already dumped but Clay 01–10 show **Missing Inputs** / “no file selected”? Copy or reseed without Blender (compose may stay up), then reload the graph:"},"3382":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-31","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#clay-loop","content":"Default layout is `schemas/house_layout.yaml` (lab penthouse matching the canned bible). `--layout` overrides. v1 does not invent a unique floorplan from prose."},"3383":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-32","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#skip-rules","content":"If"},"3384":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-33","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#skip-rules","content":"Skip"},"3385":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-34","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#skip-rules","content":"No host Blender"},"3386":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-35","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#skip-rules","content":"Workbench dump. `start` / `--seed-inputs` still render layout cameras. Language-only tour → **stills/dream-house**. Do not substitute T2I stills or `example.png` as clay"},"3387":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-36","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#skip-rules","content":"Compose is up"},"3388":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-37","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#skip-rules","content":"Blender `house-views` dump (exit 2). `./scripts/manage.sh stop` first. `--install-inputs` and `--seed-inputs` may run while compose is up"},"3389":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-38","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#skip-rules","content":"You only needed a language bible"},"3390":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-39","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#skip-rules","content":"Clay dump. Queue **stills/dream-house**"},"3391":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-40","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#occupancy","content":"One GB10 job. A Blender `house-views` dump dies if compose is up (exit 2), same XOR as `export-guides`. `--install-inputs` and `--seed-inputs` are host file writes and may run while Comfy is up. Do not Queue the clay graph and a Blender dump in one session. `restart: \"no\"`, type **yes** on start, headroom, and download-limit clear-on-exit are unchanged. Blender is never in the Dockerfile."},"3392":{"id":"/learn/dream-house-41","page_id":"/learn/dream-house","tags":["learn","klein","dream-house","blender","clay","instagram"],"type":"text","url":"/learn/dream-house#occupancy","content":"Related: Clay to finish (film Path B), DCC guide pack (1280×704 / 120f LTX packs — different contract), Asset Bible, Prompting."},"3393":{"id":"/learn/generation","page_id":"/learn/generation","type":"page","content":"Image an